# NOTE: .claude/settings.local.json is deliberately COMMITTED in this repo,
# because Lab 1 needs BOTH settings files present on a fresh clone to teach
# precedence (LAB1 sections 2.1-2.3). Many developers ignore this file globally
# in ~/.config/git/ignore, so the negation below is required to override that.
# In a real project you would NOT do this.
!.claude/settings.local.json

# After the Lab 1 precedence demo, delete the negation above if you would
# rather /sandbox writes and "don't ask again" rules stayed untracked.
